    "detailed_description": "1,2,3 Bruegel is an entertaining VR experience in 3D Real-time into the mysterious Pieter  Bruegel  the  Elder\u2019s  painting  \u201cChildren\u2019s Games\u201d: a game of hide and seek where your mission will be to find the 218 children hidden in the city. The painting is no longer a painting but a model game where you can walk around and play. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBy Gordon &amp; Andr\u00e9s Jarach<br />\r\nOriginal soundtrack: \u00c9tienne Charry<br />\r\nExecutive producer: Chlo\u00e9 Jarry<br />\r\nProduction manager: Alessandra Bogi<br />\r\n3D artist: Timoth\u00e9e Marnat / Novelab<br />\r\nPost-production 360\u00b0 studio: Maxime Villemard, Cow Prod<br />\r\nCoproducers: Camera lucida productions, Arte France<br />\r\nDistributor: Lucid Realities<br />\r\nWith the support of Centre National du Cin\u00e9ma et de l\u2019Image Anim\u00e9e - Fonds Nouveaux M\u00e9dias, Fonds Transm\u00e9dia de la Ville de Paris",
